OL,3,GNEWSAClosure of minor injuries unit
OL,4,Aextended
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe temporary closure of a minor
OL,7,Finjuries unit has been extended due to
OL,8,F"workforce pressures", bosses say.
OL,10,FNewquay Minor Injuries Unit first
OL,11,Fclosed on 21 August due to a shortage
OL,12,Fof specialist clinicians.
OL,14,FCornwall Partnership NHS Foundation
OL,15,FTrust said it had now taken the
OL,16,F"difficult decision" to extend the
OL,17,Fclosure until 2 November because it was
OL,18,Funable to provide a "safe, reliable
OL,19,Fservice".
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
