OL,3,GNEWSAClosure of minor injuries unit
OL,4,Aextended
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe trust said vacancies and sickness
OL,7,Fin recent months had to changes to
OL,8,Fopening hours at short notice and after
OL,9,Fa careful review the safest option was
OL,10,Fto "strengthen and stabilise" the
OL,11,Fservice.
